Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  23 REMOVED_MONTH 00 ACCESSIONED ON  23 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 12 55 CLINICAL DATA  DCIS  with prior radiation for Hodgkin s                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  INTERMEDIATE GRADE  MULTIPLE FOCI THROUGHOUT THE LATERAL ASPECT OF THE BREAST  SEE NOTE  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN 1 OF 1 LYMPH NODE  NOTE  Minimal invasion cannot be excluded  Blood vessel and lymphatic vessel invasion is not seen  The margin of the specimen appears free of the tumor  Despite extensive examination  only one lymph node was detected within the axillary soft tissue  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  03 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 10 54                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast and axillary sampling   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 3cm simple mastectomy specimen  with REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm of axillary tail and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm irregular overlying skin ellipse containing an eccenterically located nipple  The specimen is oriented with the short stitch marking superior and the long stitch marking lateral  The entire specimen is inked black and serially sectioned to reveal dense fibrous breast parenchyma which has focally diffused gritty areas  in the right upper outer and right lower quadrants  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  Many of these areas contain small firm cysts averaging in size 0 3cm  Two of thse gritty areas are frozen as FX 1  The closest of these gritty cystic lesions comes to within 0 9cm of the deep margin and 0 8cm to the closest anterior margin  There is also and ill defined white firm mass  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm located in the right upper outer quadrant adjacent to the axillary tail  The mass is 0 4cm from the closest deep margin and abuts the anterior margin  The small axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes  several of which are found ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE SECTION CODE  A  FX 1  section of firm area  B  Gritty area and closest anterior margins  right upper outer quadrant  C  gritty area  closest deep margin  right upper outer quadrant  D  gritty area adjacent to frozen section  deep margin right lower outer quadrant  E  gritty area  anterior margin  right lower outer quadrant  F  gritty area  deep margin  right lower outer quadrant  lateral most  G  mass from right upper outer quadrant  anterior margin  H  mass from right upper outer quadrant  posterior margin  I  fibrous tissue  J  uninvolved breast parenchyma  K N  Possible lymph nodes  Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  TWO SMALL NODULES   DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  NO DEFINITE INVASION IDENTIFIED  O R  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY , Multicentric.
